{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1384362-science-of-noetics-quantum-stuff-and-flux","id":1384362,"title":"Science of Noetics, Quantum Stuff and Flux","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-04-27T22:43:39-07:00","id":1384362,"title":"Science of Noetics, Quantum Stuff and Flux","content":"I was running a game recently (Aeon, with mixed Psion and Talent PCs) and one of the PCs had some questions about flux. <br /> <br /> The core book seems to have a different definition of flux to Aeon, with Aeon talking about Quantum Flux and corruption. In the core book, Flux is more benign, just causing weird stuff where parallel dimensions briefly interact.<br /> <br /> Is core book flux different from Quantum Flux?<br /> <br /> What does modern science (or SCIENCE!) know about it?<br /> <br /> What is the right word for the sciences of quantum stuff and flux? Is it noetics or does that just cover psions and psi-particles? Otherwise, what is a good word for the sub-quantum science of Aberrant Quantum stuff, and for the study of core book type flux?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23864-khelbiros","name":"Khelbiros","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23864_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-28T01:05:29-07:00","id":1384379,"title":"","content":"\u2018Flux\u2019 is the energy of different worlds of the Continuum running across each other, mostly in altering probabilities and events unfolding. It\u2019s Innately used by Talents although they don\u2019t consciously know they\u2019re manipulating anything. They\u2019re just lucky. It is not the same as Quantum Flux.<br /> <br /> Quantum Flux is the specific type of energy manipulated by novas. It\u2019s about controlling the fundamental forces of the universe to create effects. Novas know they\u2019re consciously manipulating energies to produce their effects. Quantum Flux and Corruption are not innately the same thing, though people of the AEon era tend to view them as such. Corruption is more the accumulation of too much Quantum Flux in an individual or area until it begins exhibiting malignancies. But smaller amounts of Quantum Flux are not inherently adverse. I don\u2019t recall that there is a specific term for the study of quantum effects, but it\u2019s not noetics.<br /> <br /> Noetics is the study of psionic energies and phenomena. <br /> <br /> Modern science knows practically nothing about flux. The Triton Foundation of the AEon Society is the closest to understanding that it even exists as something that isn\u2019t just luck, having a big advantage in people like Max Mercer as patrons, but even they haven\u2019t figured out precisely what\u2019s going on.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-28T01:15:09-07:00","id":1384380,"title":"","content":"Quantum Flux and Flux are different, completely different...<br /> <br /> Quantum flux is the excess of quantum energy in Aberrants and the target of their powers, basically it is radiation, but far worse due to the effects that can turn people and animals into monsters and the fact it is impossible to Vitakinesis to counter it. It also breaks the working of psionics as a whole. While the scientists can\u2019t counter it, they know the source and can detect with easy (and Psions detect it as a void in the noetic field).<br /> <br /> Flux (the core book flux) is the energy related to dimensional travel, affecting the time and probabilities. It is not known by science, at least not openly know. The effects of flux are very subtle, not causing diseases and environmental destruction, at least in the Aeon Era, as the level of flux is much lower than it was in Adventure Era, when it brought to \u201cour reality\u201d things (and even places) from other dimensions. Yet Aeon Society have some hidden knowledge about the workings of flux and how it can affect the flux of time and how reality works, but they can\u2019t measure or detect it as they do for quantum flux.<br /> <br /> Edit: I was writing and didn\u2019t see Bunyip answer until after posting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":24985,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","user":"Mateus Luz","date":". 04-28-2020, 04:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-28T06:14:18-07:00","id":1384394,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Khelbiros</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1384362-science-of-noetics-quantum-stuff-and-flux#post1384362\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was running a game recently (Aeon, with mixed Psion and Talent PCs) and one of the PCs had some questions about flux.<br /> <br /> The core book seems to have a different definition of flux to Aeon, with Aeon talking about Quantum Flux and corruption. In the core book, Flux is more benign, just causing weird stuff where parallel dimensions briefly interact.<br /> <br /> Is core book flux different from Quantum Flux?<br /> <br /> What does modern science (or SCIENCE!) know about it?<br /> <br /> What is the right word for the sciences of quantum stuff and flux? Is it noetics or does that just cover psions and psi-particles? Otherwise, what is a good word for the sub-quantum science of Aberrant Quantum stuff, and for the study of core book type flux?<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Think of it like spiders vs spider monkeys. There's some similar terminology going on there, but they're not the same thing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}